# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  MEROS environment variables
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env`, fill in the values, then restart Vite.
# `.env` is git-ignored — only `.env.example` is committed.
#
# Vite only exposes vars prefixed with `VITE_` to the browser bundle.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google Sign-In — OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID
#
# Where to get it:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com → your project
#   2. APIs & Services → Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client IDs
#   3. Copy the Client ID (ends in `.apps.googleusercontent.com`)
#
# Authorised JavaScript origins to add in that screen:
#   - http://localhost:5173       (Vite dev server)
#   - http://91.210.106.168       (VPS, plain IP)
#   - https://meros.website       (production domain)
#   - https://www.meros.website   (production with www)
#
# Safe to commit to a public repo — Google validates by origin, not by
# secret value. The matching client SECRET (not present here) is only
# used server-side for the future Phase C backend.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
